  "description": "Installation of a double sided internally illuminated digital display on the proposed communications hub",
  "development_type": "Minor all other minor developments",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The proposed communication hub, by virtue of its disproportionate scale and location within an area of heavy pedestrian activity, would materially reduce the effective width of the pavement along this section of the public footway. This would result in an unacceptable obstruction to pedestrian movement and would have a detrimental impact on highway and pedestrian safety. As such, the proposal is contrary to Local Plan Policy EC2 (Developing a Sustainable Local Transport Network) and Policy CC5 (Advertisement Panels, Hoardings and Structures)."
